- **Synchronized Units**: Gear ↔ Percentage ↔ Centimeter conversions are locked per attribute
- **Adjustment Presets**: Tiny/Little/Large increments for each control type
- **Motion Tracking**: Tracks whether components are in active motion
- **Status Monitoring**: Open, closed, paused states across all vehicle parts

